- Gates re-run green after the change: pytest 72 passed, ruff check +
  format clean, mypy --strict clean (14 files), audit-security no HIGH
  (`harness/logs/debrief/batch-7.log`).

## Verdict

G2: PASS — 2 fixed findings re-verified publicly + regression-locked, 3
defended with rationale above, 5 residual probes PASS.
G3: PASS — architecture, conventions, and test hygiene hold on the re-read.


