- Tests: parametrized reject tables over synthetic logs in tmp_path (no mocks),
  positive controls for the tolerance rules, all under mypy --strict; suite
  91 → 104 (+13: 2 ordered G2-1 rows landed with the fix, 11 round-7 G2-2 rows).
- Gates re-run green after the fix (`harness/logs/debrief/batch-9.log`, six
  gates, every `[exit=0]`): init.sh `[OK]` (feature_list valid — 4 features),
  pytest 104 passed, ruff check clean, ruff format --check clean (45 files),
